ind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Update","summary":"Bumper & Thumper is now part of Steam Next Fest and new demo update is available! Three New CarsThree new cars have been added to the demo, bringing the total number of vehicles to ten.Try them out, experiment with different upgrades and find the car that works best for your build. Improvements and FixesI’ve also made various improvements to the demo, including bug fixes, balance adjustments and general polish to make runs feel smoother.I’ll continue improving the demo and adding more content ba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:57:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027060","verified_at":"2026-10-21T07:07:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4696920-1846651706672806","game_id":"steam-4696920","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Top scores, ramp rewards & balance changes","summary":"New update is now available for the Bumper & Thumper Demo!Permanent Top ScoresTop scores leaderboard has been added!Your best scores on this leaderboard will no longer reset. Ramp RewardsJumping from ramps now rewards you with gold based on the distance you travel through the air.Farther you fly, more gold you earn! Bug Fixes and Balance ChangesI’ve also fixed several bugs and adjusted various balance values to make runs feel smoother and more balanced. Thank you to everyone who has played the d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:49:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4696920-1846018067927492","game_id":"steam-4696920","kind":"announcement","title":"Bumper & Thumper Demo is now live!","summary":"After a lot of work, the first public demo of Bumper & Thumper is finally available! Jump behind the wheel, smash through hordes of robots, collect upgrades and combine weapons, charms and parts to turn your car into an unstoppable machine. Every car offers a different way to play and every run gives you new opportunities to experiment with builds and create increasingly ridiculous combinations. This Is Only the BeginningI’ll keep updating the demo with new content, more build variety, balance i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T20:24:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927492","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4696920-1845383656384258","game_id":"steam-4696920","kind":"announcement","title":"Bumper & Thumper Demo launches next week!","summary":"Bumper & Thumper demo is launching next week!Jump behind the wheel, fight your way through hordes of robots and create powerful builds by combining different cars, weapons, charms, and parts.Demo Includes7 playable cars7 weapons33 charms21 partsVarious interactive objects This is only the beginning. I’ll keep updating the demo after launch with new content, more build variety and improvements based on your feedback.Wishlist Bumper & Thumper and follow the Steam page to be notified when the demo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T22:33:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656384258","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4696920-1842212951302631","game_id":"steam-4696920","kind":"announcement","title":"Bumper & Thumper Playtest is live!","summary":"I've got some news! Playtest for Bumper & Thumper is now open.If a mash-up of vehicular 